*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Describes the ImageWriter to phones and other network clients. Nothing here
*% renders the job: each format goes to the imagewriter backend unchanged.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "IMAGEWRT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Apple"
*Product: "(ImageWriter)"
*ModelName: "Apple ImageWriter"
*ShortNickName: "Apple ImageWriter"
*NickName: "Apple ImageWriter"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "application/postscript 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-postscript 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "image/jpeg 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "image/png 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "image/gif 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "image/tiff 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "text/plain 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "text/html 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "application/octet-stream 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "18 36 594 756"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
